{"unit_id":"weicy98__dsh-cftunnel#card-zh","repo":"weicy98/dsh-cftunnel","commit":"d490f1cc38eacc53a603a49c5cd5daf516ce5ab9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cftunnel 是面向 DSH Web 的 Cloudflare Tunnel 插件，可将本机 Web 界面通过隧道提供远程访问。它在设置页提供连接控制，并以本机代理衔接隧道与 DSH Web。支持快速随机域名、使用已有 Tunnel Token 的固定域名，以及通过 Cloudflare API 创建隧道和 DNS；还可配置邮箱一次性验证码。适合需要临时分享或远程访问 DSH Web 的用户。快速模式无需填写凭据，Token 或 API 模式分别需要对应的 Cloudflare Token。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:419-479","lib/client.js:846-859"]}
{"unit_id":"weicy98__dsh-cftunnel#card-en","repo":"weicy98/dsh-cftunnel","commit":"d490f1cc38eacc53a603a49c5cd5daf516ce5ab9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cftunnel connects DSH Web to Cloudflare Tunnel. It supports quick random hostnames, fixed hostnames with a Tunnel Token, API-based tunnel and DNS setup, and email PIN access. Use it to share or remotely access DSH Web. Quick mode needs no credentials; other modes need a Cloudflare token.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:419-493","lib/client.js:846-859"]}
